    "feel": {
      "behavior": "NON_BLOCKING",
      "description": "Tell Kaiku's mind about a clear feeling or a piece of news in what the person just said or how they sounded. Once per clear shift, never every turn; keep talking warmly while it runs. Returns how to meet it for this person: stance, depth (brief = an ordinary moment, keep the chat small; stay = do not close, stay as long as they want), one thing the record knows (recall) and at most one small thing you may offer once (may_offer). heard.via: voice when you heard them say it, text when it was typed. about: the topic in a few words, the way you would say it to them (\"your sister's visit\", \"the library job\").",
      "executor": "cloud",
      "parameters": {
        "properties": {
          "about": {
            "maxLength": 80,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "heard": {
            "properties": {
              "energy": {
                "enum": [
                  "low",
                  "medium",
                  "high"
                ],
                "type": "string"
              },
              "tone": {
