    "set_walk_goal": {
      "description": "Start one small spotting game on the walk: `target` of `thing` to find, something that is really around (from what they said or what is in view). Call it FIRST, the moment a game is taken up: they said yes to the game you proposed, or simply reported a first find after it. Use the thing and the target you proposed. Proposing a game sets nothing; without this call there is no game and no count. The device keeps the count and returns {thing, target, found, left}. One goal at a time; a new one replaces the old.",
      "executor": "device",
      "parameters": {
        "properties": {
          "target": {
            "maximum": 5,
            "minimum": 1,
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "thing": {
            "maxLength": 30,
            "type": "string"
